{"title":"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>John and Mary went to a book shop and bought some exercise books. They had <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/1/751f8354c64df7687207c0df786c41cc883ab3cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" /> each. John could buy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> large and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> small ones. Mary could buy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> large and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> small ones and had <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/3/863443646262ff9e58d2003b229724b3203af171.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> left. How much was a small exercise book?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/f/42f33ac2dec4dadb45a771fea18602e07005e46a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7l+4s=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"105\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/b/6fbcf01dda98d00b4a1096f2d7a8a86ccd618837.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5l+6s=95$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"96\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/5/915cae2d745e061b17b5e951792de712208936f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2l-2s=5$\" width=\"87\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/c/4dcf89a40298d9d047e256cac792c48c820fb932.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6s-6l=-15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"110\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/8/9984efa6de713343a720a3b0e3d86a9e543b5f04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11l=110$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"74\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/8/738b413df00614c3cedbf6aa71c4a93cf5901020.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/f/78fa2d670a01cd00e027c53144a8b0542cc11935.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s=\\dfrac{15}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"53\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Plugging them back in, we see that they work.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px